// Corps oaths recited as a typing test to refill willpower (press F in game).
// Oath texts supplied by the owner (the Lantern Corps oaths are DC Comics' - private use only; swap
// them for original verses before any public release). One string per corps; whitespace/newlines are
// collapsed to single spaces, so the recital is exactly the characters you see.
// `Death` has no corps in game yet; it is kept here for when one exists (unknown keys are ignored).
{
    "Death": "The Blackest Night falls from the skies, The darkness grows as all light dies,
              We crave your hearts and your demise, By my black hand, the dead shall rise!",
    "Rage": "With blood and rage of crimson red, Ripped from a corpse so freshly dead,
             Together with our hellish hate, We'll burn you all--That is your fate!",
    "Greed": "This power is mine this is my light, be it in brightest day or blackest night.
              I lay claim to all within my sight. To take what I want, THAT IS MY RIGHT!",
    "Fear": "In blackest day, in brightest night, Beware your fears made into light
             Let those who try to stop what's right, Burn like my power... Sinestro's might!",
    "Willpower": "In brightest day, in blackest night, No evil shall escape my sight.
                  Let those who worship evil's might, Beware my power, Green Lantern's light!!!",
    "Hope": "In fearful day, in raging night, With strong hearts full, our souls ignite,
             When all seems lost in the War of Light, Look to the stars-- For hope burns bright!",
    "Compassion": "Tor lorek san, bor nakka mur, Natromo faan tornek wot ur.
                   Ter Lantern ker lo Abin Sur, Taan lek lek nok--Formorrow Sur!",
    "Love": "For hearts long lost and full of fright, For those alone in blackest night,
             Accept our ring and join our fight, Love conquers all-- with violet light!",
    "Life": "Through Rage and Love, Hope and Fright, Compassion, Greed and Will to fight,
             Let darkness cower at the sight Of Life, Behold the power of White Lantern's light.",
}
